# Cloudflare Static Assets redirects.
#
# The SPA catch-all (Netlify's `/* -> /index.html 200`) is handled by
# `not_found_handling: "single-page-application"` in wrangler.jsonc, so it is
# intentionally NOT repeated here.
#
# Legacy HOST redirects (301) cannot live in this file: `_redirects` matches on
# path only, not hostname. Configure them as Cloudflare **Redirect Rules**
# (Dashboard → the uft1.com zone → Rules → Redirect Rules), one rule each:
#
#   quickchatgpt.uft1.com/*  -> https://chat.uft1.com/$1   (301, preserve path/query)
#   gptfree.uft1.com/*       -> https://chat.uft1.com/$1   (301)
#   chatgpt.uft1.com/*       -> https://chat.uft1.com/$1   (301)
#
# The old `quickchatgpt.netlify.app` host is dropped (Netlify-only; retired).
